          "document_end": 191,
          "text": "多柔体系统动力学主要研究“柔性效应”，即研究物体变形与其整体刚性运动的相互作用或耦合，以及这种耦合所导致的动力学效应。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 132,
          "end": 191,
          "chunk_start": 132,
          "chunk_end": 191,
          "sentence_document_start": 132,
          "sentence_document_end": 191,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6394585c500eae475b24",
          "document_start": 191,
          "document_end": 223,
          "text": "它是多刚体系统动力学的延伸和发展，是分析力学、连续介质力学、多刚",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 191,
          "end": 223,
          "chunk_start": 191,
          "chunk_end": 223,
          "sentence_document_start": 191,
          "sentence_document_end": 223,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_37b5503188383007047a",
          "document_start": 225,
          "document_end": 245,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 225,
          "end": 245,
          "chunk_start": 225,
          "chunk_end": 245,
          "sentence_document_start": 225,
          "sentence_document_end": 245,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f655693b5746fac68d11",
          "document_start": 246,
          "document_end": 263,
          "text": "# 2.2.2 多柔体系统动力学;",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 246,
          "end": 263,
          "chunk_start": 246,
          "chunk_end": 263,
          "sentence_document_start": 246,
          "sentence_document_end": 263,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9924fd70821035fdd473",
          "document_start": 264,
          "document_end": 296,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 264,
          "end": 296,
          "chunk_start": 264,
          "chunk_end": 296,
          "sentence_document_start": 264,
          "sentence_document_end": 296,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_d998567cf91b3180849e",
          "document_start": 298,
          "document_end": 318,
          "text": "体动力学、结构动力学学科发展交叉的必然。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 298,
          "end": 318,
          "chunk_start": 298,
          "chunk_end": 318,
          "sentence_document_start": 298,
          "sentence_document_end": 318,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1295fafca814bc188d07",
          "document_start": 318,
          "document_end": 367,
          "text": "虽然柔性多体系统动力学模型可以退化为多刚体系统动力学模型和结构动力学模型，但并非是二者的简单结合。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 318,
          "end": 367,
          "chunk_start": 318,
          "chunk_end": 367,
          "sentence_document_start": 318,
          "sentence_document_end": 367,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_55d452c1f2404965c885",
          "document_start": 367,
          "document_end": 392,
          "text": "当系统不经历大范围空间运动时，即为结构动力学方程；",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 367,
          "end": 392,
          "chunk_start": 367,
          "chunk_end": 392,
          "sentence_document_start": 367,
          "sentence_document_end": 392,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_3c677ae5e4b1979ae248",
          "document_start": 392,
          "document_end": 419,
          "text": "当各部件的变形可以忽略时，则变为多刚体系统动力学方程。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 392,
          "end": 419,
          "chunk_start": 392,
          "chunk_end": 419,
          "sentence_document_start": 392,
          "sentence_document_end": 419,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ac98e9ef3514fc06a365",
          "document_start": 419,
          "document_end": 463,
          "text": "多柔体动力学区别于多刚体系统动力学，它含有柔性部件，变形不可忽略，其逆运动学是不确定的；",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 419,
          "end": 463,
          "chunk_start": 419,
          "chunk_end": 463,
          "sentence_document_start": 419,
          "sentence_document_end": 463,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a8d1ddf11068359a70ca",
          "document_start": 463,
          "document_end": 505,
          "text": "与传统的结构动力学不同，部件在自身变形运动的同时，在空间中经历着大的刚性移动和转动。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 463,
          "end": 505,
          "chunk_start": 463,
          "chunk_end": 505,
          "sentence_document_start": 463,
          "sentence_document_end": 505,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_71e5cabad9d245d90327",
          "document_start": 505,
          "document_end": 535,
          "text": "多柔体系统动力学是一个时变、高度耦合、高度非线性的复杂系统。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 505,
          "end": 535,
          "chunk_start": 505,
          "chunk_end": 535,
          "sentence_document_start": 505,
          "sentence_document_end": 535,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_4a330962e9d3bab69356",
          "document_start": 537,
          "document_end": 557,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 537,
          "end": 557,
          "chunk_start": 537,
          "chunk_end": 557,
          "sentence_document_start": 537,
          "sentence_document_end": 557,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_799531de4b32d1d0d80c",
          "document_start": 558,
          "document_end": 575,
          "text": "# 2.2.2 多柔体系统动力学;",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 558,
          "end": 575,
          "chunk_start": 558,
          "chunk_end": 575,
          "sentence_document_start": 558,
          "sentence_document_end": 575,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6ec7b871d03076b50251",
          "document_start": 576,
          "document_end": 608,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 576,
          "end": 608,
          "chunk_start": 576,
          "chunk_end": 608,
          "sentence_document_start": 576,
          "sentence_document_end": 608,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0e9cfb58e35447464451",
          "document_start": 610,
          "document_end": 619,
          "text": "（1）坐标的选择。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 610,
          "end": 619,
          "chunk_start": 610,
          "chunk_end": 619,
          "sentence_document_start": 610,
          "sentence_document_end": 619,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_7ae0c4d1acecf3989d72",
          "document_start": 619,
          "document_end": 680,
          "text": "坐标的选择对动力学方程的建立很关键，相对坐标的优点在于处理物理变形方便，缺点是在各加速度项中出现整体刚性运动和变形的耦合。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 619,
          "end": 680,
          "chunk_start": 619,
          "chunk_end": 680,
          "sentence_document_start": 619,
          "sentence_document_end": 680,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_be3e9aff0570bdb5f950",
          "document_start": 680,
          "document_end": 729,
          "text": "因此，质量阵中会出现与变形坐标有关的项，增加了动力学方程数值求解的难度，而且容易出现数值病态现象。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 680,
          "end": 729,
          "chunk_start": 680,
          "chunk_end": 729,
          "sentence_document_start": 680,
          "sentence_document_end": 729,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_859ece8bd470dbee2ec6",
          "document_start": 729,
          "document_end": 800,
          "text": "绝对坐标的优点是无须区分物体的刚性运动和变形，均按连续介质力学的方式统一处理，绝对坐标适合描述大变形问题，主要缺点是动力学方程高度形式化繁复。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 729,
          "end": 800,
          "chunk_start": 729,
          "chunk_end": 800,
          "sentence_document_start": 729,
          "sentence_document_end": 800,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b786241b984cb17333fa",
          "document_start": 800,
          "document_end": 891,
          "text": "实际上，对小变形的多柔体系统，通常将物体的运动分解为整体刚性运动和相对变形两部分，将描述变形的变量和描述刚性运动的变量合在一起作为系统的广义坐标，通过拉格朗日方程建立系统的运动方程。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 800,
          "end": 891,
          "chunk_start": 800,
          "chunk_end": 891,
          "sentence_document_start": 800,
          "sentence_document_end": 891,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_95ea9b56835b94193e54",
          "document_start": 891,
          "document_end": 937,
          "text": "大变形的多柔体系统，则采用绝对坐标，其中动力学的表述、方程的离散化及自由度的缩减还有待优化。",
          "section_id": "section_6a17cea8f0f0",
          "start": 891,
          "end": 937,
          "chunk_start": 891,
          "chunk_end": 937,
          "sentence_document_start": 891,
          "sentence_document_end": 937,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
